  "project_description": "This module allows you to add attributes to your menu links or their wrapping \n elements.\n\n Installation ☝️ \n \n Enable Menu Link Attributes module \n Grant Use menu link attributes permission to users which should be able to set attributes on menu items \n Set available attributes on /admin/config/menu_link_attributes/config \n \n Screencasts 📺 \n \n Installation \n Container attributes \n Other widgets for editing attributes \n \n Container attributes \n In order to provide attributes for containers (wrapping \n elements) you simply need to create a new attribute starting with container_ , those will be applied on the container automatically.\n\n Optional dependency \n \n YAML Editor - Loads an Ace editor which makes YAML editing more fun \n Back to top",
